Common Questions

How do I restore my purchases?
Open the App, go to Settings, and tap Restore Purchase. This restores anything you bought earlier on the same Apple ID.

My progress was lost. Can I get it back?
Game progress is saved on your device. If you deleted and reinstalled the App, that local save cannot be recovered. Your ladder standing, raids, and bloc are tied to your account and come back when you sign in with Apple again.

How do I delete my account?
Open the App, go to Settings, then Account, then tap Delete Account and confirm. Your account and all of its data are removed from our servers right away. Your local saves stay on your device.

The game is crashing or not loading.
Close the App completely and reopen it. If that does not help, make sure you have the latest version from the App Store. Restarting your device can also help.

How do I turn off ads?
Buy the one-time Remove Ads option in Settings or the in-game Store.

